      "text": "On 11 March 2025, the Dubai Government announced the creation of the first-of-its-kind free zone focused on the sports and entertainment industry in Dubai: the International Sports and Entertainment Zone (ISEZA). \n\nIt is expected that sports federations, leagues and associations, as well as companies from the following sectors, will establish their presence at the ISEZA:",
