    {
      "text": "According to data published by the Dubai Government, Dubai’s sports industry annually contributes approximately USD 2.5 billion to the UAE’s economy. \n\nThe ISEZA will be located in the One Central district within the Dubai World Trade Centre complex. \n\nThe official ISEZA website is not yet fully operational, but it provides contact information for communicating with the free zone regarding the establishment of companies there.",
